@@ -8785,3 +8785,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-09: r11l INCREMENTAL solve (+1..+2 levels, per the MANDATORY Incremental-Progress rule): advance r11l from L1 (banked, exp3946) to LEVEL 2, and LEVEL 3 if the induced select/place mechanic + re-perception reach. Reuse the exp3946 mechanic (a click selects a color-3 piece, a 2nd click places it so the pieces' average aligns on the flkdtg target centroid) + perception. Re-perceive each new level (piece/target counts + layout change per level). Report ACCURACY_levels_solved (>=1; goal is to RAISE it past 1) + per_level_actions vs baseline_actions. RHAE weights later levels more, so L2/L3 are worth more than L1. Solving only L1 again is an HONEST complete: r11l_levels1_of6 (no regression) — do NOT fabricate higher levels. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: r11l_levels1_of6_first_fail2; results/experiment_3964_r11l_incremental_l2.json
 - 2026-06-09: lp85 INCREMENTAL solve (+1 level, per the MANDATORY Incremental-Progress rule): advance lp85-305b61c3 from L1 (banked, exp3954: 5 actions, permutation-via-button-click mechanic) to LEVEL 2, reusing the exp3954 mechanic + re-perception. Report ACCURACY_levels_solved (>=1) + new_levels_solved_this_task + per_level_actions vs baseline_actions. Re-confirming only L1 is an HONEST complete: lp85_levels1_<reason> (no regression). Do NOT fabricate higher levels; the real env's levels_completed is the only valid solve evidence. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: lp85_levels1_first_fail2; results/experiment_3965_lp85_incremental_l2.json
 - 2026-06-09: THIRD ARC-AGI-3 game first-solve: solve level-1 of the next-easiest NON-SPATIAL game (sc25-635fd71a / tn36-ef4dde99 / su15-1944f8ab / dc22 are candidates) via the perception -> induced-model -> goal-predicate -> exploit loop that produced the r11l (exp3946) and lp85 (exp3954) solves. A THIRD distinct solved game raises the generalization claim from 2->3 games (two could be coincidence; three is a method). Real-env-confirmed; pick the game empirically by L0 action budget + inducibility, do NOT hardcode the win from source. AVOID vc33's PSPACE spatial trap (see prior_failures). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: third_game_solve_sc25-635fd71a_levels1_solvedTrue; results/experiment_3966_third_game_first_solve.json
+- 2026-06-09: M3 HONEST EFFICIENCY (LOAD-BEARING — the existential 'verifier earns its place' proof, redo of the FABRICATED exp3959): on the REAL games SOLVED so far (banked r11l L1 + lp85 L1, plus any new levels from exp3964/3965), run the solver in two arms with the verifier GENUINELY IN THE LOOP — (i) WITH the Carnot verifier action-pruner (select_verifier_pruned_action / consistency-energy ranks the legal actions), (ii) ablation with the pruner DISABLED (uniform-random legal-action order, same perception + same goal). Count REAL env.step actions-to-solve per arm; bootstrap 95% CIs. Emit anti-fabrication self-audit: verifier_invoked_in_loop + actions_from_real_env + n_real_env_steps MUST be true/non-zero or the run is invalid. Non-overlapping CIs in the pruner-helps direction = the verifier earns its place on a real, externally-defined benchmark. RHAE squares action-efficiency, so a real pruning win is a direct score win AND Carnot's cleanest existential evidence. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_verifier_not_in_loop; results/experiment_3967_m3_honest_efficiency.json
